{"rank": 106, "root": "حشر", "form": 1, "lemma": "حَشَرَ", "count": 37, "ayahCount": 37, "share": 0.19, "meaning": {"bs": "sakupiti, okupiti", "en": "to gather, to assemble", "tr": "toplamak, bir araya getirmek", "fr": "rassembler, réunir", "id": "mengumpulkan, menghimpun", "ur": "جمع کرنا، اکٹھا کرنا", "bn": "সমবেত করা, একত্র করা", "fa": "گرد آوردن، جمع کردن"}, "lemmaSpoken": "audio/c772b6d9627f392b1664.m4a", "animation": "<svg class=\"va va-hashara_1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 72\"><style> @keyframes hashara_1-ws{from{transform:rotate(-24deg)}}@keyframes hashara_1-wt{from{transform:rotate(24deg)}}.va-hashara_1 .ll,.va-hashara_1 .ra{transform:rotate(24deg);animation:hashara_1-ws 0.5s ease-in-out 5 alternate both}.va-hashara_1 .rl,.va-hashara_1 .la{transform:rotate(-24deg);animation:hashara_1-wt 0.5s ease-in-out 5 alternate both}@keyframes hashara_1-m{from{transform:translateX(-44px)}}.va-hashara_1 .fig{animation:hashara_1-m 2.5s linear both}@keyframes hashara_1-n{from{transform:translateX(-24px)}}.va-hashara_1 .c .fig{animation-name:hashara_1-n}.f,.p{fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.f{stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:4.5}.t{stroke-width:8}.h{fill:var(--accent)}.p{stroke:var(--gold);stroke-width:3}.q{fill:var(--gold)}.va-hashara_1.off,.va-hashara_1.off *{animation:none!important}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.va-hashara_1,.va-hashara_1 *{animation:none!important}}</style><path class=\"p\" d=\"M6 61H114\"/><g transform=\"translate(40 44)\"><g class=\"fig\"><g class=\"ll\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v17\"/></g><g class=\"rl\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v17\"/></g><g class=\"tr\"><path class=\"f t\" d=\"M0 0V-17\"/><circle class=\"h\" cy=\"-26\" r=\"6.5\"/><g transform=\"translate(0 -15)\"><g class=\"la\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v14\"/></g></g><g transform=\"translate(0 -15)\"><g class=\"ra\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v14\"/></g></g></g></g></g><g class=\"c\"><g transform=\"translate(60 44)\"><g class=\"fig\">